  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"472\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"154\">About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"157\">Walnut Supply Co. creates handcrafted wooden watches, watch boxes, and accessories made from natural materials like walnut, ebony, and maple. Many models include personalized engraving, making them ideal for weddings, anniversaries, birthdays, and meaningful gifts. Every piece arrives in a gift-ready wooden box.</p><p data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"745\"><strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"502\">What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"505\">We offer heritage-inspired wooden timepieces that combine natural wood with reliable movements and custom engraving. Our products feel premium without luxury pricing, creating a perfect balance of uniqueness, quality, and approachability.</p><p data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"957\"><strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"775\">How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"778\">Affiliates receive a <strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"817\">10% commission</strong> on every sale made through their referral link. With above-average order values, each conversion represents a strong earning opportunity.</p><p data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1241\"><strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"981\">How to promote us:</strong><br data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"984\">Promote Walnut Supply Co. by sharing our watches in lifestyle content, fashion and gift guides, TikTok/Instagram reels, YouTube reviews, or wedding and groomsmen gift ideas. Highlight personalization, eco-friendly wood materials, and gift-ready packaging.</p><p data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1521\"><strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1265\">Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1268\">We supply affiliates with high-quality product photos, lifestyle imagery, and promotional copy. All orders ship quickly with tracking and include a one-year warranty. Our watches resonate with men’s fashion, gifting, and lifestyle audiences worldwide.</p></div></div>",
